            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "flsistercook"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent. I used garlic powder (as I had no garlic cloves) and added onion powder. Also, I subbed nonfat yogurt for the sour cream. Great recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2011-02-17T06:14:30.950Z"
          },
