              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BAKINGBETTY88"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Whoa. So yummy!! and a tasty spin on salt &amp; pepper-seasoned scrambled eggs. I used cilantro/parsley mix, garlic/parsley butter, and left out the milk because it doesn't agree with me (though sour cream is fine), and crema agria (mexican sour cream) + powdered parm (kind used for spaghetti). So delicious!!",
            "datePublished": "2010-02-03T02:47:04.500Z"
          },
